        "parsed_datetime": "2026-05-06T17:58:06.377Z",
        "repost_content": {
          "id": "7457821947121496064",
          "date": "2mo",
          "parsed_datetime": "2026-05-06T16:01:51.825Z",
          "text": "Payroll isn’t broken. It’s just been stuck in the same aging model for decades.\n\nThat’s finally changing.\n\nIf you’re heading to #PayCon, join me for a live session where we’ll show what “payroll made easier” actually looks like in practice featuring a real-world payroll pro.\n\n Wednesday, May 13\n 12:15pm – 1:00pm\n Closed Theater on the Expo Floor\n\nI’ll be joined by Heidi Shimp - Fava at Senior Living Communities, LLC, who’s living this shift firsthand. We’ll walk through how payroll teams are navigating:\n- Clearer pay visibility\n- Low-lift integration (no heavy operational burden)\n- Reducing compliance complexity instead of adding to it\n\nAnd we’ll leave plenty of time for candid Q&A. See you there!",
          "author": {
            "public_identifier": "katelcheesman",
            "id": "ACoAAARQrjwBa5d-RbT9LQQuXQ3ssvPwGL4c6v0",
            "name": "Kate Cheesman",
            "is_company": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
